[20:58:10] ## Context
[20:58:10] The existing requirement specifies that the adjustable maximum displayed recipe count and Show all belong inside the Calculation controls panel'"'s Displayed results subgroup. The completed smoke-repair story records that those controls currently render in the results toolbar, while filters and search are in the panel. This work concerns presentation placement; it must retain the existing display-only behavior and backend-authoritative result values.
[20:58:10] ## Acceptance Criteria
